{"page":"theater","mainClass":"shell app-main","main":"<div id=\"connection-error\" class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" hidden><p id=\"connection-error-text\"></p><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button small\" data-retry-state>Retry connection</button><button class=\"button small\" data-follow-current>Follow current run</button></div></div><div id=\"action-message\" class=\"notice\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><div class=\"page-heading reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"status-dot\"></i> 02 / Live demo · Watch the boundary hold</p><h1>Don’t take our word for it.<br>Run the protocol.</h1><p>One button starts a server-owned Arc testnet story. Follow the money from routine payroll to the recovery receipt.</p></div><div class=\"heading-aside\">Real transactions.<br>Constructed attack facts.<br>Everything labeled.</div></div><section class=\"demo-stage reveal\"><div class=\"demo-stage-top\"><div><p class=\"section-label\"><i class=\"status-dot\"></i> REPAYD CONTROL PLANE</p><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;margin-top:5px\">A payment meets its boundary.</h2></div><div id=\"theater-status\" class=\"run-state-label\"><span class=\"pill\">Ready to run</span></div></div><div class=\"demo-scene\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">THE LOOP</p><h2>Let agents act.<br><em>Keep risk in bounds.</em></h2><p>Four routine payments. One frozen hold. One mined policy revert. One controlled miss. One recovery that closes the loop.</p></div><div class=\"demo-network\"><div class=\"demo-node\"><svg class=\"brand-shield\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 72\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M32 2 60 12v22c0 17-11 30-28 38C15 64 4 51 4 34V12L32 2Z\" fill=\"#d1fc70\" stroke=\"#20251d\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M32 14 50 21v13c0 11-7 20-18 26-11-6-18-15-18-26V21l18-7Z\" fill=\"#20251d\"/><path d=\"M32 22v25m-8-16 8-3 8 3\" stroke=\"#d1fc70\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>Agent</span><small>proposes</small></div><div class=\"demo-connector\"></div><div