iting.</h3><p>Press Run demo. The server keeps the run if you navigate away.</p></div></div></section><details class=\"journal-disclosure section\"><summary>How to read this demonstration <span class=\"chevron\">+</span></summary><div class=\"disclosure-body\"><div class=\"two-column\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">WHAT THE CHAIN PROVES</p><p>Balances, confirmed receipts, reverted calls, blocks, and token transfers are read from Arc testnet. Open a journal item for its explorer link.</p></div><div><p class=\"section-label\">WHAT IS CONSTRUCTED</p><p>Attack history, clock facts, watcher reasoning, and owner-origin judgment are local demo inputs. They are marked as local, not presented as TEE attestations.</p></div></div></div></details><section class=\"section surface\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Next</p><h2>Go from spectacle to evidence.</h2></div><span class=\"pill\">After the run</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"/record\" data-run-link=\"/record\" data-requires-run aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">Open agent record ↗</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"/flow\" data-run-link=\"/flow\" data-requires-run aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">Inspect every receipt ↗</a></div></section><div id=\"theater-balances\" hidden></div><p id=\"theater-snapshot-note\" hidden></p><div id=\"theater-checks\" hidden></div><div id=\"check-count\" hidden></div><div id=\"latest-action\" hidden></div><div id=\"theater-pool\" hidden></div><div id=\"theater-contracts\" hidden></div><p id=\"run-id\" hidden></p><button id=\"copy-run-id\" hidden data-copy=\"run\"></button><p id=\"event-count\" hidden></p><p id=\"receipt-count\" hidden></p><p id=\"runner-heartbeat\" hidden></p><div id=\"connection-status\" class=\"connection-line\" data-connection=\"offline\"><span><i class=\"status-dot\"></i><span id=\"connection-label\">Connecting to saved state</span></span><span id=\"connection-age\">Waiting for server</span></div>",